<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>FCIP Agentic AI Roadmap</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,300&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --ink: #0d0f14;
  --paper: #f4f1eb;
  --accent: #c8421a;
  --blue: #1a5c8a;
  --green: #2d6a4f;
  --amber: #7b5e2a;
  --purple: #6b2d6b;
  --rule: #d4cfc4;
  --muted: #8a8478;
  --card: #fff;
  --tag-bg: #e8e4db;

  /* Phase colours */
  --p1: #2d6a4f;
  --p2: #1a5c8a;
  --p3: #7b5e2a;
  --p4: #6b2d6b;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

body {
  font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif;
  background: var(--paper);
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

/* ── NAV BAR ── */
.nav-bar {
  background: var(--accent);
  color: white;
  padding: 0.6rem 3rem;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
}
.nav-bar a {
  color: white;
  text-decoration: none;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  opacity: 0.9;
  transition: opacity 0.15s;
}
.nav-bar a:hover { opacity: 1; }

/* ── HEADER ── */
header {
  background: var(--ink);
  color: var(--paper);
  padding: 3.5rem 3rem 3rem;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}

header::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  bottom: -80px; right: -80px;
  width: 400px; height: 400px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 80px solid rgba(107,45,107,0.12);
  pointer-events: none;
}

header::after {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  top: -60px; left: 40%;
  width: 250px; height: 250px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 50px solid rgba(26,92,138,0.1);
  pointer-events: none;
}

.header-kicker {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

header h1 {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.05;
  letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

header h1 em {
  color: #a78bdb;
  font-style: italic;
}

.header-intro {
  font-size: 1rem;
  color: #a8a298;
  max-width: 600px;
  font-weight: 300;
  line-height: 1.65;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.header-stats {
  display: flex;
  gap: 2.5rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.stat {
  text-align: left;
}

.stat-num {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--paper);
  line-height: 1;
}

.stat-label {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #6e6860;
  margin-top: 0.2rem;
}

/* ── MAIN LAYOUT ── */
.layout {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
  min-height: calc(100vh - 300px);
}

/* ── SIDEBAR ── */
.sidebar {
  border-right: 1px solid var(--rule);
  padding: 2rem 0;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  height: 100vh;
  overflow-y: auto;
}

.sidebar-section {
  padding: 0 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.sidebar-section:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

.sidebar-heading {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.16em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

.sidebar-link {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem;
  border-radius: 5px;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  color: var(--ink);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.15s;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.sidebar-link:hover { background: var(--tag-bg); }
.sidebar-link.active { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); font-weight: 500; }

.sidebar-link .dot {
  width: 6px; height: 6px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

/* ── CONTENT AREA ── */
.content {
  padding: 3rem;
  max-width: 1000px;
}

.section {
  margin-bottom: 5rem;
  scroll-margin-top: 2rem;
}

.section-kicker {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.section h2 {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
  line-height: 1.15;
}

.section-intro {
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  color: #444;
  line-height: 1.7;
  max-width: 720px;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

hr.section-rule {
  border: none;
  border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

/* ── PHASE TIMELINE ── */
.timeline {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0;
  position: relative;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.timeline::before {
  content: '';
  position: absolute;
  left: 27px;
  top: 0; bottom: 0;
  width: 2px;
  background: var(--rule);
  z-index: 0;
}

.phase-card {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  padding: 1.5rem 0;
  position: relative;
}

.phase-num {
  width: 56px;
  height: 56px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: white;
  z-index: 1;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  position: relative;
}

.phase-body {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--rule);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 1.5rem;
  transition: box-shadow 0.2s;
}

.phase-body:hover {
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(13,15,20,0.07);
}

.phase-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
}

.phase-title {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 1.25;
}

.phase-badge {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  padding: 0.25rem 0.7rem;
  border-radius: 20px;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  font-weight: 500;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.phase-desc {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  color: #444;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
}

.phase-items {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 0.75rem;
}

.phase-item {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  line-height: 1.45;
}

.phase-item-dot {
  width: 5px; height: 5px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin-top: 0.45rem;
}

.phase-item strong {
  font-weight: 600;
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
}

.phase-item span {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.77rem;
}

/* Phase colours */
.phase-card.p1 .phase-num { background: var(--p1); }
.phase-card.p2 .phase-num { background: var(--p2); }
.phase-card.p3 .phase-num { background: var(--p3); }
.phase-card.p4 .phase-num { background: var(--p4); }

.phase-card.p1 .phase-body { border-left: 3px solid var(--p1); }
.phase-card.p2 .phase-body { border-left: 3px solid var(--p2); }
.phase-card.p3 .phase-body { border-left: 3px solid var(--p3); }
.phase-card.p4 .phase-body { border-left: 3px solid var(--p4); }

.phase-card.p1 .phase-badge { background: rgba(45,106,79,0.1); color: var(--p1); }
.phase-card.p2 .phase-badge { background: rgba(26,92,138,0.1); color: var(--p2); }
.phase-card.p3 .phase-badge { background: rgba(123,94,42,0.1); color: var(--p3); }
.phase-card.p4 .phase-badge { background: rgba(107,45,107,0.1); color: var(--p4); }

.phase-card.p1 .phase-item-dot { background: var(--p1); }
.phase-card.p2 .phase-item-dot { background: var(--p2); }
.phase-card.p3 .phase-item-dot { background: var(--p3); }
.phase-card.p4 .phase-item-dot { background: var(--p4); }

/* ── ARCHITECTURE DIAGRAM ── */
.arch-diagram {
  background: var(--ink);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 2rem;
  color: var(--paper);
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  overflow-x: auto;
}

.arch-title {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.15em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #6e6860;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.arch-layers {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.6rem;
}

.arch-layer {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
  gap: 1rem;
  align-items: center;
}

.arch-layer-label {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: #6e6860;
  text-align: right;
}

.arch-layer-boxes {
  display: flex;
  gap: 0.5rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.arch-box {
  padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
  border-radius: 5px;
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  letter-spacing: 0.03em;
}

.arch-box.human { background: rgba(45,106,79,0.25); color: #7ec8a0; border: 1px solid rgba(45,106,79,0.4); }
.arch-box.agent { background: rgba(107,45,107,0.3); color: #c8a0e0; border: 1px solid rgba(107,45,107,0.5); }
.arch-box.tool { background: rgba(26,92,138,0.25); color: #80b8d8; border: 1px solid rgba(26,92,138,0.4); }
.arch-box.data { background: rgba(123,94,42,0.25); color: #d4a860; border: 1px solid rgba(123,94,42,0.4); }
.arch-box.guard { background: rgba(200,66,26,0.2); color: #f08060; border: 1px solid rgba(200,66,26,0.4); }

.arch-connector {
  text-align: center;
  color: #3a3730;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  padding: 0.2rem 0;
  margin-left: 140px;
}

/* ── CAPABILITY TABLE ── */
.cap-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 0.83rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.cap-table th {
  text-align: left;
  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ink);
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--muted);
}

.cap-table td {
  padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  vertical-align: top;
}

.cap-table tr:hover td { background: #f9f7f2; }

.cap-name {
  font-weight: 600;
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}

.cap-desc {
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 0.2rem;
}

.status-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-weight: 500;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.status-now { background: rgba(45,106,79,0.12); color: var(--p1); }
.status-q3 { background: rgba(26,92,138,0.12); color: var(--p2); }
.status-q4 { background: rgba(123,94,42,0.12); color: var(--p3); }
.status-future { background: rgba(107,45,107,0.12); color: var(--p4); }

/* ── RISK TABLE ── */
.risk-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.risk-card {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--rule);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 1.25rem;
}

.risk-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 0.6rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
}

.risk-icon {
  width: 28px; height: 28px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.risk-title {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.risk-body {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: #444;
  line-height: 1.55;
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
}

.risk-mitigation {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  color: var(--muted);
  padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
  background: var(--tag-bg);
  border-radius: 5px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.risk-mitigation strong {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  color: var(--ink);
}

/* ── DECISION CHECKLIST ── */
.decision-list {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.75rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.decision-item {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
  gap: 1rem;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--rule);
  border-radius: 8px;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: all 0.15s;
  user-select: none;
}

.decision-item:hover { border-color: #b8b3a8; }
.decision-item.checked { border-color: var(--green); background: rgba(45,106,79,0.04); }

.decision-checkbox {
  width: 20px; height: 20px;
  border-radius: 5px;
  border: 2px solid var(--rule);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  transition: all 0.15s;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.decision-item.checked .decision-checkbox {
  background: var(--green);
  border-color: var(--green);
  color: white;
}

.decision-text {
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  line-height: 1.45;
}

.decision-text strong {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
}

.decision-text span {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 0.8rem;
}

.decision-owner {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  text-align: right;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

/* ── PROMPT FLOW DIAGRAM ── */
.flow {
  display: flex;
  align-items: stretch;
  gap: 0;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  overflow-x: auto;
  padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.flow-step {
  min-width: 140px;
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--rule);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 1rem;
  flex: 1;
  position: relative;
}

.flow-step::after {
  content: '→';
  position: absolute;
  right: -18px;
  top: 50%;
  transform: translateY(-50%);
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: 1rem;
  z-index: 1;
}

.flow-step:last-child::after { display: none; }

.flow-step + .flow-step { margin-left: 18px; }

.flow-icon {
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
}

.flow-title {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
}

.flow-desc {
  font-size: 0.72rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.4;
}

.flow-phase {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.6rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  padding: 0.15rem 0.4rem;
  border-radius: 3px;
  display: inline-block;
}

/* ── INFO BOX ── */
.info-box {
  border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
  background: rgba(26,92,138,0.06);
  padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  border-radius: 0 7px 7px 0;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #333;
}

.info-box strong {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--blue);
  margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
}

.warn-box {
  border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
  background: rgba(200,66,26,0.06);
  padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
  border-radius: 0 7px 7px 0;
  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  line-height: 1.6;
  color: #333;
}

.warn-box strong {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
}

/* ── MCP GRID ── */
.mcp-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
}

.mcp-card {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--rule);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 1.25rem;
  transition: all 0.15s;
}

.mcp-card:hover {
  border-color: #b8b3a8;
  box-shadow: 0 3px 12px rgba(13,15,20,0.06);
}

.mcp-icon {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
}

.mcp-name {
  font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
}

.mcp-url {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.62rem;
  color: var(--blue);
  margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
  word-break: break-all;
}

.mcp-desc {
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.mcp-phase {
  font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
  font-size: 0.6rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  margin-top: 0.75rem;
  padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
  border-radius: 3px;
  display: inline-block;
}

/* ── SCROLLBAR ── */
::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--paper); }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--rule); border-radius: 3px; }

/* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
  .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .sidebar { display: none; }
  .content { padding: 1.5rem; }
  header { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
  .nav-bar { padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem; }
  .phase-items { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .risk-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .flow { flex-direction: column; }
  .flow-step::after { display: none; }
  .flow-step + .flow-step { margin-left: 0; margin-top: 0.75rem; }
  .mcp-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .header-stats { gap: 1.5rem; }
  .arch-layer { grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="nav-bar">
  <span>FCIP PRODUCT TOOLING — AGENTIC ROADMAP</span>
  <a href="fcip-prompt-bank.html">← BACK TO PROMPT BANK</a>
</div>

<header>
  <div class="header-kicker">Financial Crime Investigations Platform</div>
  <h1>Roadmap to<br><em>Agentic AI</em></h1>
  <p class="header-intro">A phased delivery plan for evolving FCIP's AI capability from manual prompt-and-copy today to a fully autonomous product operations agent — integrated with Jira, Confluence, and the broader compliance toolchain.</p>
  <div class="header-stats">
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-num">4</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Delivery Phases</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-num">14</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Capabilities</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-num">3</div>
      <div class="stat-label">MCP Integrations</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat">
      <div class="stat-num">~12mo</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Full Agentic Horizon</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="layout">
  <aside class="sidebar">
